        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4811, Arts & Crafts Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arts and Crafts Handleset's classic styling makes it a great choice for historic homes. With the textured plate and square cut-outs, the Arts & Crafts Handleset has a rustic look that will make an impressive statement on any door. The 3/4 Escutcheon Plate Arts and Crafts Front Door Handle is available in dummy and single cylinder functions. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the 3/4 Escutcheon Plate Arts and Crafts Front Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Arts and Crafts Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4801-specifications.pdf?v=1704262353\"><b>Emtek 4811 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4-finish.jpg?v=1704354746\" width=\"339\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
